"The villagers lured to Toth's castle are fed alive to his creature."
"The creature eats only thinking beings caught unaware; if it smells fear it kills but will not eat."
"The creature has evolved twice in weeks: claws and teleporting, then regrowth and dissolving flesh."
"Toth forbids feeding it children; his steward Marley coldly suggests it."
"Marley wears the creature's emerald Ring of Control, and the ring has become unreliable."
"The serving woman Lisa, who ferried villagers in, was likely sent to feed the creature and eaten."
